{"PageNumber":437,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":19,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا يَسۡتَوِي ٱلۡأَعۡمَىٰ وَٱلۡبَصِيرُ","TajweedText":"وَمَا يَسْتَوِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَعْمَىٰ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَص<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>رُ <span class=end>١٩</span>","End":"١٩","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":378,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":20,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَا ٱلظُّلُمَٰتُ وَلَا ٱلنُّورُ","TajweedText":"وَلَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ظُّلُمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تُ وَلَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>رُ <span class=end>٢٠</span>","End":"٢٠","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":378,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":21,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَا ٱلظِّلُّ وَلَا ٱلۡحَرُورُ","TajweedText":"وَلَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ظِّلُّ وَلَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>رُ <span class=end>٢١</span>","End":"٢١","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":378,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":22,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا يَسۡتَوِي ٱلۡأَحۡيَآءُ وَلَا ٱلۡأَمۡوَٰتُۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُسۡمِعُ مَن يَشَآءُۖ وَمَآ أَنتَ بِمُسۡمِعٖ مَّن فِي ٱلۡقُبُورِ","TajweedText":"وَمَا يَسْتَوِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَحْي<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءُ وَلَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَمْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تُۚ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ يُسْمِعُ م<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َش<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءُۖ وَم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ بِمُسْمِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>عٍ م</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ف</tajweed>ِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقُب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>رِ <span class=end>٢٢</span>","End":"٢٢","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":378,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":23,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنۡ أَنتَ إِلَّا نَذِيرٌ","TajweedText":"إِنْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ إِلَّا نَذ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>رٌ <span class=end>٢٣</span>","End":"٢٣","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":378,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":24,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّآ أَرۡسَلۡنَٰكَ بِٱلۡحَقِّ بَشِيرٗا وَنَذِيرٗاۚ وَإِن مِّنۡ أُمَّةٍ إِلَّا خَلَا فِيهَا نَذِيرٞ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَرْسَلْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقِّ بَشِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رًا و</tajweed>َنَذِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رًاۚ و</tajweed>َإ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>ِّنْ أُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َةٍ إِلَّا خَلَا فِيهَا نَذ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>رٌ <span class=end>٢٤</span>","End":"٢٤","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":378,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":25,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِن يُكَذِّبُوكَ فَقَدۡ كَذَّبَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبۡلِهِمۡ جَآءَتۡهُمۡ رُسُلُهُم بِٱلۡبَيِّنَٰتِ وَبِٱلزُّبُرِ وَبِٱلۡكِتَٰبِ ٱلۡمُنِيرِ","TajweedText":"وَإ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن ي</tajweed>ُكَذِّبُوكَ فَقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> كَذَّبَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لِهِمْ ج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَتْهُمْ رُسُلُه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَيِّنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِ وَبِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>زُّبُرِ وَبِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكِتَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>رِ <span class=end>٢٥</span>","End":"٢٥","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":378,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":26,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ثُمَّ أَخَذۡتُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْۖ فَكَيۡفَ كَانَ نَكِيرِ","TajweedText":"ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ أَخَذْتُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْۖ</tajweed> فَكَيْفَ كَانَ نَك<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>رِ <span class=end>٢٦</span>","End":"٢٦","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":378,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":27,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَلَمۡ تَرَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ أَنزَلَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءٗ فَأَخۡرَجۡنَا بِهِۦ ثَمَرَٰتٖ مُّخۡتَلِفًا أَلۡوَٰنُهَاۚ وَمِنَ ٱلۡجِبَالِ جُدَدُۢ بِيضٞ وَحُمۡرٞ مُّخۡتَلِفٌ أَلۡوَٰنُهَا وَغَرَابِيبُ سُودٞ","TajweedText":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نز</tajweed>َلَ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ م<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ءً ف</tajweed>َأَخْرَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>نَا بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> ثَمَر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>تٍ م</tajweed>ُّخْتَلِفًا أَلْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>نُهَاۚ وَمِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْجِبَالِ جُدَ<tajweed class=iqlab>دُۢ ب</tajweed>ِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ضٌ و</tajweed>َحُمْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ م</tajweed>ُّخْتَلِفٌ أَلْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>نُهَا وَغَرَابِيبُ س<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>د</tajweed>ٌ <span class=end>٢٧</span>","End":"٢٧","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":379,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":28,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ وَٱلدَّوَآبِّ وَٱلۡأَنۡعَٰمِ مُخۡتَلِفٌ أَلۡوَٰنُهُۥ كَذَٰلِكَۗ إِنَّمَا يَخۡشَى ٱللَّهَ مِنۡ عِبَادِهِ ٱلۡعُلَمَـٰٓؤُاْۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَزِيزٌ غَفُورٌ","TajweedText":"وَمِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>دَّو<tajweed class=madda_necessary>َا</tajweed>ٓبِّ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَنْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مِ مُخْتَلِفٌ أَلْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>نُهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> كَذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَۗ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَا يَخْشَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ مِنْ عِبَادِهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعُلَمَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ؤُ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed>ۗ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ عَزِيزٌ غَف<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>رٌ <span class=end>٢٨</span>","End":"٢٨","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":379,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":29,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَتۡلُونَ كِتَٰبَ ٱللَّهِ وَأَقَامُواْ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَأَنفَقُواْ مِمَّا رَزَقۡنَٰهُمۡ سِرّٗا وَعَلَانِيَةٗ يَرۡجُونَ تِجَٰرَةٗ لَّن تَبُورَ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ يَتْلُونَ كِتَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ وَأَقَامُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّلَ<tajweed class=slnt>و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>ٲ</tajweed>ةَ وَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نف</tajweed>َقُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا رَزَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ سِر<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ًّا و</tajweed>َعَلَانِيَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً ي</tajweed>َرْجُونَ تِجَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةً ل</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>رَ <span class=end>٢٩</span>","End":"٢٩","PageNumber":437,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":379,"MaqraNumber":175,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":35,"SurahIndex":"035","VerseNumber":30,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لِيُوَفِّيَهُمۡ أُجُورَهُمۡ وَيَزِيدَهُم مِّن فَضۡلِهِۦٓۚ إِنَّهُۥ غَفُورٞ شَكُورٞ","TajweedText":"لِيُوَفِّيَهُمْ أُجُورَهُمْ وَيَزِيدَه<